        </div>
        <div class="voice-card glass">
            <div class="card-icon gold">&#x1f9e0;</div>
            <h3>AI Understanding</h3>
            <p>Our AI goes beyond keywords. It understands context, intent, and the nuance of your career goals.</p>
        </div>
