    </div>
    <div class="steps">
        <div class="step glass">
            <div class="step-number">1</div>
            <h3>Create Your Profile</h3>
            <p>Sign up and tell us about yourself — your skills, experience, and what you're looking for.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step glass">
            <div class="step-number">2</div>
            <h3>Speak to AI</h3>
            <p>Use your voice to describe your ideal role. Our AI listens and learns what makes you unique.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step glass">
            <div class="step-number">3</div>
            <h3>Get Matched</h3>
            <p>Receive curated job matches ranked by relevance. Apply with confidence knowing they fit.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
